<title>ESTONIA: BOURSE CLOSING:TALSE DRIFTS, VOLUMES LOWER.</title>
<headline>BOURSE CLOSING:TALSE DRIFTS, VOLUMES LOWER.</headline>
<text>
<p>* Preliminary data from the Estonian bourse on Monday put</p>
<p>total trade at 21.9 million kroons versus 32.2 million kroons on</p>
<p>Friday.</p>
<p>* The Talse online index lost 0.77 percent to close at</p>
<p>250.21. (See index on stock exchange web site:</p>
<p>http://www.tse.ee/online/total.htm)</p>
<p>* Preliminary closing data put Hansapank 2.36</p>
<p>kroons lower at 127.55 kroons with a volume of 6.7 million</p>
<p>kroons.</p>
</text>
